WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.897
Kip was near the street.

2
00:00:21.898 --> 00:00:29.412
People walked and talked.

3
00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:34.373
Cars zoomed by.

4
00:00:34.374 --> 00:00:37.181
Suddenly Kip heard a loud whistle.

5
00:00:37.182 --> 00:00:43.654
All the cars stopped.

6
00:00:43.655 --> 00:00:46.239
Kip looked around.

7
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.515
He saw a woman in the street.

8
00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.441
The woman looked very serious.

9
00:00:52.442 --> 00:00:54.815
She wore a hat and a badge.

10
00:00:54.816 --> 00:00:57.271
She had a whistle.

11
00:00:57.272 --> 00:01:00.471
"A police officer!" said Kip.

12
00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:02.979
People were waiting to cross the street.

13
00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.488
The police officer waved to them.

14
00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:08.224
The people walked across the street.

15
00:01:08.225 --> 00:01:12.324
"Wow," said Kip.

16
00:01:12.325 --> 00:01:14.907
A woman rode a bike fast.

17
00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.926
The police officer blew her whistle.

18
00:01:17.927 --> 00:01:28.026
The woman slowed down.

19
00:01:28.027 --> 00:01:31.998
A man dropped a cup on the sidewalk.

20
00:01:31.999 --> 00:01:36.009
"No littering, sir," said the police officer.

21
00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.385
"Sorry," said the man.

22
00:01:38.386 --> 00:01:40.769
He picked up the cup.

23
00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.925
"Wow," said Kip.

24
00:01:43.926 --> 00:01:49.067
"I want to be a police officer!"
